# build/ is latexmk's working directory and the PDF is rebuilt from source, so none
# of it is committed. This differs from the tree the preamble came from, which
# versioned its finished PDF because that PDF was the thing being submitted. Here the
# document is still being written, and a 15 MB binary changing on every build would
# dominate the history of a repository whose point is the source.
build/

# Written by tools/results2tex.py from the measurement output. Regenerable by
# definition, and committing it would let a stale number outlive the run it came from.
generated/
